      <p begin="00:25.540" end="00:27.090" ttm:agent="v1">You see my mother****ing car isn't stock</p>
      <p begin="00:27.090" end="00:29.810" ttm:agent="v1">I used to piss in a pot and now I piss on the walls</p>
      <p begin="00:29.810" end="00:32.310" ttm:agent="v1">Since I pissed off a cop a couple tickets I have copped</p>
      <p begin="00:32.310" end="00:33.810" ttm:agent="v1">But I can pay for them all</p>
      <p begin="00:33.790" end="00:36.430" ttm:agent="v1">And by the model of my vehicle you know that I ball</p>
      <p begin="00:36.430" end="00:39.040" ttm:agent="v1">A 92 but 91 the year that tyler was spawned</p>
      <p begin="00:39.040" end="00:40.540" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:39.540" end="00:41.770" ttm:agent="v1">And if I crash then I'ma follow with this</p>
