      <p begin="00:49.270" end="00:51.100" ttm:agent="v1">Might take back street hidden house</p>
      <p begin="00:51.100" end="00:52.600" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:51.650" end="00:53.630" ttm:agent="v1">Got sports car like like heres the</p>
      <p begin="00:53.630" end="00:56.500" ttm:agent="v1">Two sapphires on your neck that's his precious gems</p>
      <p begin="00:56.500" end="00:59.400" ttm:agent="v1">Now amg it's in boy I will eat him</p>
      <p begin="00:59.400" end="01:02.200" ttm:agent="v1">You angry you got that old b***h with those deep rims</p>
      <p begin="01:02.200" end="01:04.280" ttm:agent="v1">You got a warranty don't care if you scratchin rims again</p>
      <p begin="01:04.280" end="01:12.280" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:12.880" end="01:16.610" ttm:agent="v1">We can speed in my 2 seater</p>
      <p begin="01:16.610" end="01:18.180" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:18.180" end="01:19.680" ttm:agent="v1">Girl I got a 2 seater</p>
